  M_D    `>= 1' -> `>= 0'   (the predicted SWEEP)  predict 10/10 -> floor breach
  M_E    `&& a1 != 0' appended (disclosed joint)   predict 10/10 -> clause (e) debt

  Every mutant is applied by literal text replacement, with MUTANT-TEXT-NOT-FOUND
